* `data.py` – Load delivery dataset and split into training and testing sets.
* `features.py` – Includes functions to validate and describe single deliveries (including computation of average speed).
* `model.py` – Train, evaluate, save and load machine learning model.
* `validate.py` – Validates if a delivery includes valid values in all required fields.
* `__init__.py` – Marks `delivery` directory as a Python package.
* `train.py` – Execute end-to-end training of the model from the command line.
